@startuml Generation_Pipeline_Flow
!theme plain
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #F0F4FF
skinparam activityBorderColor #4A6FA5
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #4A6FA5
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #4A6FA5
skinparam activityStartBackgroundColor #4CAF50
skinparam activityEndBackgroundColor #F44336
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF9C4
skinparam noteBorderColor #F9A825
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 50

|title EXAM GENERATION PIPELINE (LangGraph StateGraph)\nDashed box = HITL Human-in-the-Loop

|#wheat|START|
start

|#palegreen|#palegreen:**① initialize**
:Reset state;\nSet default values;\n:Reset retry_count = 0;

|#lightblue|**② clarification_check**
if (Requirements clear?) then (yes)
  :requirements_clear → load_long_term_memory;
else (no)
  #lightyellow:**③ emit_clarification**
  :Emit clarification questions\nto frontend via WebSocket;
  stop
endif

|#lightblue|**④ load_long_term_memory**
:Load teacher_preferences\nfrom PostgreSQL;
:Inject preferred Bloom\ndistribution if available;

|#lightblue|**⑤ decide_plan**
if (Complex request?\n(prompt>200 chars, keywords,\nextra_instructions)) then (complex)
  :plan_complex → Retrieval;
else (simple)
  :→ Retrieval Agent;
endif

|#lightyellow|**⑥ retrieve_knowledge**\n(Retrieval Agent)
:Query expansion:\nLLM generates 3-5 query variants;
fork
  :Query chapter_1\nPinecone namespace;\n30s timeout;
fork again
  :Query chapter_2\nPinecone namespace;\n30s timeout;
end fork
:CrossEncoder rerank:\ntop-20 → top-8 per chapter;
:Token budget enforcement:\nCap at 12,000 tokens;
note right: Global fallback if all\nscoped chapters return 0
:Output: retrieved_chunks\n+ coverage_map;

if (Retrieval success?) then (yes)
  :→ create_outline;
else (no)
  #lightcoral:**handle_retrieval_failure**
  :Use partial/fallback context;\nWarning logged;
  :→ create_outline;
endif

|#lightblue|**⑦ create_outline**\n(Outline Agent)
:LLM generates blueprint:\nslots by Bloom × Chapter;
:Convert % → counts\n(largest-remainder method);
note right: MCQ-only: strip essay slots\nEssay-only: strip MCQ slots
:Enforce chapter coverage:\nEach scope chapter ≥ 1 slot;\nRedistribute or add if missing;
note right: Pad/truncate to match\nmcq_count + essay_count
if (Bloom mismatch?) then (yes)
  :Retry with explicit\nBloom feedback;
endif
if (LLM failed?) then (yes)
  :Fallback: round-robin\ndefault blueprint;
endif
:Output: blueprint[]\n+ distribution_summary;

if (Outline success?) then (yes)
  :→ emit_checkpoint_1;
else (no)
  #lightcoral:**handle_outline_failure**
  :Return error;\nstop
endif

|#wheat|***HUMAN-IN-THE-LOOP 1***|

|#gold|**⑧ emit_checkpoint_1**
:Emit WebSocket:\n{"type":"hitl_checkpoint",\n"checkpoint_id":1,\n"data":{blueprint,\ndistribution_summary}};
note right: Frontend displays\nblueprint for review

|#orange|**⑨ wait_for_blueprint_approval**\n(LangGraph INTERRUPT)
:Graph PAUSED;\nawait frontend response;
if (Approved?) then (yes)
  :→ build_questions;
elseif (Rejected?) then (no)
  :Re-run create_outline\nwith feedback (G8);
  :→ emit_checkpoint_1;
else (timeout)
  #lightcoral:**handle_timeout**
  stop
endif

|#lightblue|**⑩ build_questions**\n(Builder Agent)
while (for each blueprint chunk\nof 5 slots) is (≤ 5 concurrent)
  :Per-slot context filtering:\nmatch chapter → relevant chunks;
  note right: Match strategies:\n1. Exact chapter match\n2. Normalized match\n3. chapter_id match\n4. Number fallback
  :Inject Bloom-specific\ntemplate guide;
  if (van_dung_cao?) then (yes)
    :search_similar_problems\n(SerpAPI wrapper);
  endif
  :LLM generates question;\n:JSON parsing (3 layers):\n1. _extract_json_brackets\n2. _sanitize_latex_escapes\n3. _repair_json_string;
  if (Parse success?) then (yes)
  else (no, 2 retries)
    :Fallback: demo question\nfrom context (Bug-020);
  endif
  :Guardrails pipeline:\n- bloom_classifier skill\n- dedup_checker skill\n- scope_guard inline;
end while
:Output: questions[]\n+ topics_used[];

if (Builder success?) then (yes)
  :→ validate_questions;
else (no)
  #lightcoral:**handle_builder_failure**
  :Warning logged;\n:→ emit_checkpoint_2;
endif

|#lightblue|**⑪ validate_questions**\n(Validator Agent)
:Batches of 10 questions\nper LLM call (not 1/call);
note right: 45 questions = 5 LLM calls\ninstead of 45+ calls
:For each batch, check:\n1. Answer correctness\n2. Bloom compliance\n3. Scope violation;
:Confidence scoring:\n>0.8: reject\n0.5-0.8: warn only\n<0.5: skip;
:Issues persisted to Redis\n(ShortTermMemory);
:Output: validation_passed,\nissues[], bloom_compliance;

|#lightblue|**⑫ check_validation_result**
if (Validation passed?) then (yes)
  :→ emit_checkpoint_2;
elseif (retry_count < 3?) then (yes)
  #lightyellow:**⑬ retry_builder**
  :retry_count++;\n:Inject issues from Redis;\n:→ build_questions;
  note right: G9: max 3 retries
else (max exceeded)
  #lightcoral:**⑭ handle_max_retries_exceeded**
  :Warning logged;\n:→ emit_checkpoint_2;
endif

|#wheat|***HUMAN-IN-THE-LOOP 2***|

|#gold|**⑮ emit_checkpoint_2**
:Emit WebSocket:\n{"type":"hitl_checkpoint",\n"checkpoint_id":2,\n"data":{questions,\nvalidation_passed, issues}};
note right: Frontend displays\nfull exam for review

|#orange|**⑯ wait_for_review**\n(LangGraph INTERRUPT)
:Graph PAUSED;\nawait frontend response;
if (Approved?) then (yes)
  :→ save_teacher_preferences;
elseif (Rejected?) then (no)
  #lightcoral:**finalize_with_feedback**
  :Store rejection feedback;\nstop
else (timeout)
  #lightcoral:**handle_timeout**
  stop
endif

|#lightblue|**⑰ save_teacher_preferences**
:Persist to PostgreSQL:\nteacher_preferences table;

|#gold|**⑱ emit_checkpoint_3**
:Emit WebSocket:\n{"type":"hitl_checkpoint",\n"checkpoint_id":3,\n"data":{export_preview}};
note right: Frontend shows\nexport preview

|#lightblue|**⑲ finalize_output**
:Persist questions + cost_report\nto exams table (JSONB);
:Emit WebSocket:\n{"type":"completed", "exam_id":...};

|#wheat|END|
stop

|#wheat|START|
start

#lightblue|**Document Upload Flow (parallel)**

:**POST /documents/upload**
:Save file to MinIO/S3;
:Create documents row (pending);
:Background task → parse pipeline;
note right: ws/document/{doc_id}\nstreams progress

#lightyellow|Parse pipeline|
:① marker-pdf parse\n(fallback: PyMuPDF);
:② Heading tree detection\n(chapters → sections → subsections);
:③ Formula extract\n(Nougat / MathPix);
:④ Image extract\n(Qwen Vision via ngrok);
:⑤ Semantic chunking\n(SemanticSplitterNodeParser);
:⑥ Embed\n(BAAI/bge-m3, cache Redis);
:⑦ Upsert Pinecone\n(namespace={doc_id}_{ch_id});
:Update status → completed;
:**emit document_uploaded event**;
stop

@enduml
